    rdfs:label "Payment: paymentdue paymentautomaticallyapplied states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the paymentdue paymentautomaticallyapplied path of the Payment workflow, in order: PaymentDue, PaymentAutomaticallyApplied. A transition is legal between adjacent states. A payment's status per schema.org PaymentStatusType: due, past due, complete, declined, automatically applied." ;
